5px + 55.4455%); display:inline-block;\">45%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:99.0099%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.9901%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:99.0099%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.9901%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:99.0099%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.9901%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond%20Arena\">Svargrond Arena</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tHe is more vicious than a regular <a href=\"#/wiki/Efreet\">Efreet</a>, fights in close combat. Kreebosh the Exile never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTo all vocations it is <i>heavily</i> recommended to wear a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> because you may exit the arena by mistake or not be able to reach the next pit if you are heavily drunk (note that drunk lasts for several minutes so you will be affected in the next pits as well).<br/>\nDruids and Sorcerers: Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> and use SD while running to kill fast before he summons.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a>: As you do not need to move while fighting him, wear a skill ring (<a href=\"#/wiki/Sword%20Ring\">Sword Ring</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Axe%20Ring\">Axe Ring</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a>) rather than a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a>. If you are drunk after the battle, equip a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a>. You should also use Exori and Blood Rage to kill faster. If you are lucky, he will not summon any <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Djinn\">Green Djinns</a>.<br/>\nPaladins: Run in circles and shoot if he has 2 summoned djinns you may run arround them to avoid get hit by the boss berserk and melee.\nBe careful, because he can summon both djinns at the same time, breaking up your shielding and making powerful combos that might kill you in a second.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Djinn\">Djinn</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Djinn\">Blue Djinn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Efreet\">Efreet</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fahim%20the%20Wise\">Fahim the Wise</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Djinn\">Green Djinn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Marid\">Marid</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Merikh%20the%20Slaughterer\">Merikh the Slaughterer</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["barbarian-arena-quest"]}